Apply against publicsuffix/list@main:

    git apply infra/psl/public_suffix_list.patch

Line numbers are as of the 2026-07-28 snapshot of the list; if the file
has moved on, insert the block by position instead — alphabetically by
entity name, between the `freedesktop.org` and `freemyip.com` blocks.

